WEBVTT

00:35:28.941 --> 00:35:30.425
But most importantly,

00:35:30.449 --> 00:35:35.989
some of them are building infrastructure
that entrepreneurs can't afford to do.

00:35:36.013 --> 00:35:38.867
So take autonomous vehicles,
as an example.

00:35:38.891 --> 00:35:42.137
US is ahead of China in the technology,

00:35:42.161 --> 00:35:45.308
but it's all about who launches fast,

00:35:45.332 --> 00:35:48.879
gets data and gets
the training loop going.

00:35:48.903 --> 00:35:53.831
So what the Chinese government is doing
is paving new highways

00:35:53.855 --> 00:35:58.985
that have sensors that help
make autonomous vehicles safer.

00:35:59.340 --> 00:36:02.101
One example is the city of Xiongan,